{"id":174,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，教育部语言文字应用管理司、共青团中央青年发展部公布2026年“千团万人推普强国行”全国大学生暑期社会实践志愿服务活动入选名单。我校经济与管理学院“晋声筑梦推普实践队”、计算机科学与技术学院“党员先锋暑期社会实践团”成功入选全国重点团队。</p><p>“晋声筑梦推普实践队”以“推普赋能+职业技能提升”为核心方向，面向杂粮种植户、电商主播、集市商户等涉农基层群体，统筹开展语言国情调查、法治宣传教育专项工作，以通用语言赋能乡村产业发展。“党员先锋暑期社会实践团”立足全国党建样板支部平台，创新打造“智能测评+分层教学+云端长效服务”数智化推普普法服务模式，依托专业技术优势打通基层语言服务工作壁垒。</p><p>据悉，本次活动共吸引全国1515所高校、8117支团队、8万余名师生报名参与，经国家级语言文字推广基地专家严格评审，仅1010支团队获评全国重点团队。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MzlWanRC4n7l8nHz-aM8MRMzGZU8lgDoRf7Mm9PoRlsoR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ysokhVLSh7Lmn7o7QfozUPUl-PMmn7Mmr7o7CYLmC4L7rFo7l8o7VRnNQFM7-bLllJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMz9agtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7580&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/278E1D24D8FA941AB164D65D8F22630E/8E48ACFF/4B91E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MzlWanRC4n7l8nHz-aM8MRMzGZU8lgDoRf7Mm9PoRlsoR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ysokhVLSh7Lmn7o7QfozUPUl-PMmn7Mmr7o7CYLmC4L7rFo7l8o7VRnNQFM7-bLllJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMz9agtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7580&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-M7VWkL7V7nzTkLH7-Yn7WfnlU8MzlgYL8MVMm7DU4T7M4N0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDLYysUYh2LRffnml8MmA2LlCao7V7nRG4nRV7MNW2U4TFLmGZM778MmWFozTRnRCJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMz9agtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7580&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8637CF00AF5468F1F08ADD03D1D6BFC9/2084A462/99CD6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-L7nWfM8WVM4NDMHzWkMznVUzNbU8VgVL4LsMmMkUN-iMRl0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yanSh2nkyYozA7LmU4nm-ZozCin7CsLNV2nmLDL8UsM7QFMRA2oRNYU4MFLz9YL4LbgtXaQ4Oeo4x86YhXptQ0g47aL4-0M4lZLkbw62L8c&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7580&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"https://tw.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=-MzlWanRC4n7l8nHz-aM8MRMzGZU8lgDoRf7Mm9PoRlsoR-0gihFp2hmCIa0L1ysokhVLSh7Lmn7o7QfozUPUl-PMmn7Mmr7o7CYLmC4L7rFo7l8o7VRnNQFM7-bLllJqjfjo4OeosnsgDTJQty0LzG4L1ysMz9agtA8pULcc&oid=1366454638&tid=1032&nid=7580&e=.jpg"}